id=myfg
name=MyFG
version=v0.22
versionCode=22
author=@teldommm
description=Zygisk frame generation (BufferQueue capture + WFG optical flow + ASurfaceControl overlay). Stage 1-3 from OpenFG: PTS-phase interpolation, QCOM hardware ME with half-res GPU field refinement (OpenFG refine pass), split submits (blit goes to the GPU before the blocking ME readback), Y-sign self-test and me=used/dropped stats; battery thermal throttling. Settings via WebUI, stored in the module directory. Requires Zygisk.
